  "known_gaps": [
    {
      "edge": {
        "src": "py:web@app.client.fetch_by_var",
        "dst": "py:billing@endpoint:GET /v1/orders/{order_id}",
        "kind": "CONSUMES"
      },
      "why": "PREDICTED BEFORE SCORING. `httpx.get(f\"/v1/orders/{order_id}\")` builds its path from an f-string, and `python_client._literal` reads only literal constants \u2014 so no call is collected at all and there is nothing for the joiner to place. A real recall miss in extraction, not in the join, and counted as one rather than exempted. The literal `/v1/orders/42` two lines above is what actually exercises template matching."
    }
